# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Video
#
# The site's video lives on the server, not in git. This is not a preference —
# assets/images/px-showreel.mp4 is 125MB and GitHub hard-rejects any push
# containing a file over 100MB, so a commit that included it could never be
# pushed at all. The five .mp4 files in the tree come to 232MB between them.
#
# CONSEQUENCE: a fresh clone will NOT have a working showreel. index.html and
# thankyou.html both reference px-showreel.mp4, and index.html also references
# Avanza-Blades-Intro.mp4 (the Video Studio card). Upload those to the server
# separately, as you do now, or move them to Git LFS and delete this block.
*.mp4
*.mov

# Server-side secrets. ps-config.php reads SMTP and reCAPTCHA credentials from
# environment variables first and this file second; it is deliberately absent
# from the working tree today (only ps-secrets.example.php ships). Listed here
# so it can never be committed by accident if someone creates it later.
assets/email-php/ps-secrets.php

# OS and editor noise
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Local tooling
.claude/launch.json
node_modules/
